menu "pw_i2c"

config PIGWEED_I2C
  bool "Use the pw_i2c_zephyr module"
  help
    I2C initiators for Zephyr drivers. Gives pw_i2c's libraries Zephyr's
    compile flags; link pw_i2c_zephyr to the code that uses it. Also
    requires pw_sync.mutex and pw_chrono.system_clock backends -- CMake
    will fail the build naming either that isn't configured.

config PIGWEED_I2C_RESPONDER
  bool "Use the responder implementation for Zephyr"
  help
    The pw_i2c_zephyr.responder API. This doesn't link it: link
    pw_i2c_zephyr.responder to the code that uses it.

endmenu
